{"server":"en","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_04_beg","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_04","title":"The General","storyCode":"OF-4","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"361ec8a998c1bb663ac7a9b9d1fe57d02a9ba7ae9e88d54d3831da5231c01e16","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sunnytown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"Alpha, Bravo, stay back and monitor them carefully. Charlie, wrap around and flank them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"Mercenaries, huh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"Whoever trained them must've been rather skilled. Not bad, but also not good enough."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bodyguard","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"Th-this old man is strong!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"You're no match for him. Stand by for now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"(This woman... won't be simple to deal with.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"(These bodyguards won't be able to harm me, but she poses a threat.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"Foolish outsiders..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"(She's angry now.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"(Perhaps from her perspective, she really believes that we deceived Miss Ceylon.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"(But, something's not right. Just who is she...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"You must be a pretty experienced mercenary, staying disciplined even though your Mistress is gone."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bodyguard","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"Cut the crap! Since you know that our boss was... Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"Shut up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"(Hmm...? Wait... A crossbow, Feline, and that name...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"(Where have I heard that name before...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bodyguard","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait, what is this geezer doing?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"(I'm a bit worried about how the Doctor is doing.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"(...But the Doctor is capable enough, as are the others. There shouldn't be any issue.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bodyguard","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"Is he senile or something? He's charging straight at us!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bodyguard","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"Hurry, stop him!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hellagur","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"You'll have to be faster than that!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_188_helage","aliases":["Hellagur"]},{"speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","aliases":["Schwarz"]}]}
